          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103001,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a creare le <strong>funzioni freccia</strong>. Fanno parte dello standard JavaScript ES6 e vengono usate per scrivere codice più pulito e conciso.</p><p>Riscriviamo la funzione qui sotto come funzione freccia usando una sola riga di codice.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a creare le <strong>funzioni freccia</strong>. Fanno parte dello standard JavaScript ES6 e vengono usate per scrivere codice più pulito e conciso.</p><p>Riscriviamo la funzione qui sotto come funzione freccia usando una sola riga di codice.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hello'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const greeting = () =&gt; 'Hi';</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Anonymous Function",
            "id": 103846,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni freccia sono un tipo di <strong>funzione</strong><strong>anonima</strong>, ovvero non hanno un nome di funzione.</p><p>Se vogliamo chiamare queste funzioni, dobbiamo memorizzarle all'interno di una variabile e chiamare la variabile con le parentesi alla fine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const greeting</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>greeting()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni freccia sono un tipo di <strong>funzione</strong><strong>anonima</strong>, ovvero non hanno un nome di funzione.</p><p>Se vogliamo chiamare queste funzioni, dobbiamo memorizzarle all'interno di una variabile e chiamare la variabile con le parentesi alla fine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Hi'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getGreeting());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const greeting</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>greeting()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parentheses",
            "id": 103847,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con le funzioni freccia, non abbiamo bisogno della parola chiave <code>function</code> né del nome della funzione. Questo significa che la prima cosa da cui iniziamo sono le parentesi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameter",
            "id": 103848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per le funzioni normali, possiamo aggiungere parametri tra le parentesi e poi usare i parametri all'interno della funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>firstName</code>, seguito da <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per le funzioni normali, possiamo aggiungere parametri tra le parentesi e poi usare i parametri all'interno della funzione.</p><p>Usa lo stesso nome di parametro della funzione normale e restituisci il saluto creato con quell'argomento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"firstName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + firstName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greeting(\" /><text value=\"'Tony'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Tony'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Tony\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>firstName</code>, seguito da <code>return</code> e infine <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow operator",
            "id": 103004,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subito dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura aggiungiamo l'operatore freccia <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Usiamo questo operatore subito prima del blocco di codice o dell'espressione che vogliamo far eseguire alla funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subito dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura aggiungiamo l'operatore freccia <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Usiamo questo operatore subito prima del blocco di codice o dell'espressione che vogliamo far eseguire alla funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hello = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" helloArrowFunction = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hello());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(helloArrowFunction());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greeting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getGreeting\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Greetings \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come con le funzioni tradizionali, usiamo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> per contenere il blocco di codice di una funzione freccia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come con le funzioni tradizionali, usiamo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> per contenere il blocco di codice di una funzione freccia.</p><p>Completa il blocco e restituisci un saluto usando la variabile locale <code>name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"'Elizabeth'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>name</code> e infine <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One body statement",
            "id": 103006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se una arrow function contiene una sola istruzione, possiamo omettere sia le parentesi graffe sia la parola chiave <code>return</code> per ottenere un codice molto breve.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>'Greetings'</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se una arrow function contiene una sola istruzione, possiamo omettere sia le parentesi graffe sia la parola chiave <code>return</code> per ottenere un codice molto breve.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Greetings'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return 'Greetings' }\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>greetings</code>, seguito da <code>'Greetings'</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove aggiungiamo l'operatore freccia <code>=&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dopo la parola chiave <code>function</code> e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura <code>{</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inizi una funzione freccia che riceve <code>name</code>. Quale frammento collega correttamente il suo elenco di parametri al blocco di codice?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>(name) =&gt; {</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=&gt; (name) {</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>(name) { =&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(name) =&gt; {</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fanno le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> in una arrow function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Contengono il blocco di codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Si usano per chiamare una funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Contengono il blocco di codice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>const getScore = () =&gt; { return 10; };</code>, quale parte è racchiusa tra le parentesi graffe della funzione freccia?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return 10;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>() =&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>getScore()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return 10;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One body statement",
            "id": 103702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo abbreviare il codice seguente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuovendo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> e la parola chiave <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuovendo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> e la parola chiave <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbrevi questa funzione, ma deve comunque restituire <code>\"Hello\"</code>. Quale sostituzione produce lo stesso risultato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = =&gt; \"Hello\";</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; { \"Hello\"; };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const greetings = () =&gt; \"Hello\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 103704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la seguente arrow function?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>greetings;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>greetings();</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi eseguire <code>greetings</code> e memorizzare il testo restituito in <code>message</code>. Quale riga lo fa?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" position = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello Jane!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const message = greetings();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const message = greetings.position;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const message = greetings();</code>.</p></body></html>"
