            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica l'operatore freccia, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehiclesCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"4003\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehiclesCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4003\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One body statement",
            "id": 103709,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai in modo che la funzione restituisca il valore <code>400</code> scrivendo la funzione freccia più breve possibile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getVehiclesCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getVehiclesCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>()</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con una sola espressione, una funzione freccia può omettere le parentesi graffe e <code>return</code>; l'espressione diventa il risultato.</p><p>Crea la funzione freccia più breve che restituisce il valore memorizzato in <code>count</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"count\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"count\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getVehiclesCount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>()</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>count</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
